msgid "Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN LIDAR Interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:7
#: 4ab38519a76f46a58cd09b9954d3f025
msgid "The `Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN LIDAR Interface <https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__ is a tiny interface for `several common laser rangefinders <https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface#currently-supported-lasers>`__ that allows connection to Pixhawk and other similar autopilots via DroneCAN - A nice robust interface, which provides high reliability connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:17
#: 5acc0378362f4b8fb69cee5b0459ac5a
msgid "The following parameters should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the autopilot):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:19
#: 07bf5c89fbb54e17982ddeae3bed0b97
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:20
#: 36671d7f0b1c46c49d453deb4b1a6ad1
msgid "``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` = 24"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:21
#: dca8a4575bc84002b0094aaae7bcc55f
msgid "``RNGFNDx_MIN`` based on your connected laser's datasheet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:22
#: 02c60d3320054581a563ac65b18b19ac
msgid "``RNGFNDx_MAX`` based on your connected laser's datasheet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:25
#: fffa5381b41649e982626659897432dd
msgid "If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps and then set the ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` parameter to 24."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:27
#: 30972a5fb7404d8bb47fc5eb5f036add
msgid "If the rangefinder attached is NOT a ``Lightware SF11/c``, then the DroneCAN internal ``rangefinder_hw`` parameter of this unit must be set to the appropriate rangefinder type using the SLCAN instructions above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:29
#: de8ab341f28e474ea1e66953a7a89ce5
msgid "The `manufacturer's product page is here <https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__ for general information about the device."
msgstr ""
